  content into a lesson. `lessons.py promote` is the only path into the repository
  and is run deliberately by a person; at 50 dated entries the oldest reusable
  entries are consolidated into `## Durable practices`.
- `lessons.py add` leaves the repository worktree untouched, so it is safe even
  when project instructions forbid unrelated worktree changes. Skip the lesson
  entirely when instructions prohibit recording one.

